        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "两次晨昏交替，已经算是宽限了。相较之下，我给各位的时间只有一天。"
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  一天？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "一天？"
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  我要各位在一天之内解决所有事情。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "我要各位在一天之内解决所有事情。"
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 165,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  魏大人，如果有他们的帮助，我们不是可以在几小时里解决掉整合运动，彻底地减少损失吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "魏大人，如果有他们的帮助，我们不是可以在几小时里解决掉整合运动，彻底地减少损失吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 166,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 167,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  那并不重要。龙门的问题，龙门自己理应能一劳永逸地解决，这才是我们的首要宗旨。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "那并不重要。龙门的问题，龙门自己理应能一劳永逸地解决，这才是我们的首要宗旨。"
    },
    {
        "id": 168,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  这是我们应该让他们看见的。所以，各位，开始吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "这是我们应该让他们看见的。所以，各位，开始吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 169,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  去吧，陈警官，该让整合运动厘清龙门的待客之道了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "去吧，陈警官，该让整合运动厘清龙门的待客之道了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 170,
        "raw": "[playsound(key=\"$d_gen_transmissionget\", volume=0.4)]",
        "type": "play_sound",
        "key": "audio/sound_beta_2/avg/d_gen_transmissionget.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "id": 171,
        "raw": "[CharacterCutin(widgetID=\"1\", name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\", style=\"cutin\", fadestyle= \"horiz_expand_center\", fadetime=0.5, offsetx=-300, width=200, block=true)]",
