        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 173,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  明白。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "明白。"
    },
    {
        "id": 174,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  魏长官，我有一个问题。即使你现在无法给出回答，我也希望事情过去之后，你能给我一个合理的猜想。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "魏长官，我有一个问题。即使你现在无法给出回答，我也希望事情过去之后，你能给我一个合理的猜想。"
    },
    {
        "id": 175,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 176,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  你可以问。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "你可以问。"
    },
    {
        "id": 177,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 178,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  这明明是整合运动的总攻，那为什么它们的领袖塔露拉没有出现在龙门？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "这明明是整合运动的总攻，那为什么它们的领袖塔露拉没有出现在龙门？"
    },
    {
        "id": 179,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
