    {
        "id": 187,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 188,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  事情不是进行得很顺利吗，你怎么在这愁眉苦脸的？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "事情不是进行得很顺利吗，你怎么在这愁眉苦脸的？"
    },
    {
        "id": 189,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 190,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  乌萨斯方面还是没有任何回应？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "乌萨斯方面还是没有任何回应？"
    },
    {
        "id": 191,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 192,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  依然没有。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "依然没有。"
    },
    {
        "id": 193,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 194,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  还是联系不上维特议长？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "还是联系不上维特议长？"
    },
    {
        "id": 195,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 196,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  很遗憾，信使至今都没能和他会面。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "很遗憾，信使至今都没能和他会面。"
    },
    {
        "id": 197,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 198,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  看来整个乌萨斯帝国，也笼罩在一片疑云之中啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "看来整个乌萨斯帝国，也笼罩在一片疑云之中啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 199,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  文月，我有种感觉。这一切可能只是个开始。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "文月，我有种感觉。这一切可能只是个开始。"
    },
    {
        "id": 200,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 201,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  上次你这么说，已经是很多年前了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "上次你这么说，已经是很多年前了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 202,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 203,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  那是什么时候？我已经完全忘记了自己这么说的理由。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "那是什么时候？我已经完全忘记了自己这么说的理由。"
    },
    {
        "id": 204,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 205,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  那时我们可是刚见面没多久。难道你是想说，你已经把我们间的过往都忘了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "那时我们可是刚见面没多久。难道你是想说，你已经把我们间的过往都忘了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 206,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 207,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  不，不会。我怎么敢。只是除了和你相遇以外的事情，我都记不太清了而已。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "不，不会。我怎么敢。只是除了和你相遇以外的事情，我都记不太清了而已。"
    },
    {
        "id": 208,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 209,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  瞧你这副伶牙俐齿。很可惜，这事你是忘不了的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "瞧你这副伶牙俐齿。很可惜，这事你是忘不了的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 210,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  毕竟你亲口对我说过，如果二十年前我们输了，这座城市会改名换姓，成为乌萨斯征服史的另一条脚注。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "毕竟你亲口对我说过，如果二十年前我们输了，这座城市会改名换姓，成为乌萨斯征服史的另一条脚注。"
    },
    {
        "id": 211,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  如果我们输了，坐在你现在的位置的不会是你，而是他。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "如果我们输了，坐在你现在的位置的不会是你，而是他。"
    },
    {
        "id": 212,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 213,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 214,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  科西切公爵。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "科西切公爵。"
    },
    {
        "id": 215,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 216,
        "raw": "[name=\"文月\"]  哎，可怜的小塔，你能说小塔身上没有他的影子吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "文月",
        "content": "哎，可怜的小塔，你能说小塔身上没有他的影子吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 217,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 218,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  但他已经死了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "但他已经死了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 219,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"]  被塔露拉亲手所杀。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "被塔露拉亲手所杀。"
    },
